### Local smoke requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
### 1) Get a token for the demo user "alice" (tenant "acme", role "admin") from the dev realm.
###    Direct access grants are enabled on the dev-only "modular-monolith-cli" client.
@host = http://localhost:5080
@keycloak = http://localhost:8080/realms/modular-monolith

# @name token
POST {{keycloak}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=modular-monolith-cli&username=alice&password=alice&scope=openid

###
@accessToken = {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### Register the caller's profile (publishes UserRegisteredIntegrationEvent -> Catalog sellers)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/identity/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: register-alice-1

{ "email": "alice@acme.test", "displayName": "Alice" }

### Create a product (idempotent)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: create-widget-1

{ "name": "Widget", "sku": "WID-001", "price": 19.99, "currency": "USD" }

### List products of the caller's tenant (paged: page >= 1, 1 <= pageSize <= 100)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get one product (use the id from the Location header of the create call)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Health and metrics (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

###
GET {{host}}/metrics
